      "content": "By reframing the pilot phase as a proof-of-concept, you can shift the focus from limitations to the significance and hypothesis-generating potential of the study. This approach can also help to highlight the methodology's strengths, such as the rigorous design and experimental protocol. Emphasize how the findings from the pilot phase laid the groundwork for the larger study, which can inform investors, clinicians, or future researchers about the potential implications of this work.",
