    "summary": "The user is asking the assistant for advice on how to write a research paper methodology to downplay a small sample size (n=12) that might lead to rejection. The assistant suggests framing the study as a \"proof-of-concept\" or \"pilot phase\" to shift the focus away from the statistical limitations and toward the significance of the findings.",
